<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style=""><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The lead you own {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} in the SAL Stage, needs to be contacted. An activity (Email or Phone Call) must be logged within 2 business days after moving to the SAL Stage. Please attempt to contact {!Lead.Name} and log the activity.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Click&nbsp;<a href="{!Lead.Link}">here</a><a href="https://intel.my.salesforce.com//p/email/template/EmailTemplateEditorUi/{!Lead.Link}" style="">&nbsp;</a>to visit this lead record in SFDC</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Leads move to a terminated state if there is no activity for 30 days and 90 days since the creation date.</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you.</font></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>